      "Status": "wired"
    },
    {
      "RuleId": "R-TIME-TARGET-ANSWERED",
      "Stage": "compliance",
      "Consumer": "Test-OutputTimeClaims",
      "ConsumerFile": "scripts/lib/time_claims.ps1",
      "Codes": [
        "FACT_TIME_TARGET_UNANSWERED"
      ],
      "Evidence": "each TimeExpectation (target id, original/canonical place, zone, real UTC offset, local clock/date) derived from the full Decision.TimeTargets and the SAME RuntimeContext must be answered by an OutputTimeClaim bound to that target: an answered clock must match the target's clock AND the stated place/offset; same-clock or same-offset different named places are never merged",
      "Version": "2026-10-05.3",
      "Sample": "third_fix_time_binding.tests.ps1#T01",
      "Status": "wired"
    },
    {
      "RuleId": "R-TIME-TARGET-CLARIFIED",
      "Stage": "compliance",
      "Consumer": "Test-OutputTimeClaims",
      "ConsumerFile": "scripts/lib/time_claims.ps1",
      "Codes": [
        "FACT_TIME_TARGET_UNCLARIFIED"
      ],
      "Evidence": "every unresolved target must be named inside an explicit place/time-zone clarification question; naming one target does not cover another, and a plain statement that mentions the place ('The shipment is going to Atlantis.') is not a time clarification",
      "Version": "2026-10-05.3",
      "Sample": "third_fix_time_binding.tests.ps1#T05",
      "Status": "wired"
